{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","无畏战歌"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","生成光环，对周围友军提供增益。自身对敌人造成足够伤害时将可治疗光环内的友军。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生成一个跟随自己的半径2格的无畏光环，使其中的友军提高40点急速和10点远程防御，自己额外提升30点急速和10点远程防御。当曼卡拉在光环存在期间累计对敌人造成相当于自身初始攻击力300%的伤害时，产生一道治愈音波，为光环内的所有友军恢复-80% − 10% ATK生命值。无畏光环持续10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":122,"end":128,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":118,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","治愈音波恢复的生命值提高至-90% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","无畏光环的持续时间延长至12秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","治愈音波恢复的生命值提高至-100% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","治愈音波恢复的生命值提高至-110% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","角逐擂台"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战场中央生成荣耀擂台，己方夺取其控制权后获得全队增益。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，在战场中央生成一座横跨战场的荣耀擂台，持续至战斗结束。当荣耀擂台范围内的敌我其中一方的单位数量超过另一方时，便会开始抢夺荣耀擂台，并在维持人数优势3秒后获得荣耀擂台的控制权。\n当己方控制荣耀擂台时，己方全体单位提升14% + 1%攻击力，并且每秒恢复-12% − 2% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":116,"end":121,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":135,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":131,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当己方控制荣耀擂台时，己方获得的攻击力加成提高至16% + 1%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当己方控制荣耀擂台时，己方获得的攻击力加成提高至18% + 1%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","当己方控制荣耀擂台时，己方获得的攻击力加成提高至20% + 1%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","活力铃音"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己和两名友军恢复生命，并暂时提高护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","摇晃铃铛，为自己和另外2名最虚弱的友军恢复-130% − 20% ATK生命值，并使其护甲与魔抗提高40%，持续5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":21,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能恢复的生命值提高至-150% − 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能恢复的生命值提高至-170% − 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能恢复的生命值提高至-190% − 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升9%，且当己方控制荣耀擂台时，自身的攻击力额外提升6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%，且当己方控制荣耀擂台时，自身的攻击力额外提升8%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升15%，且当己方控制荣耀擂台时，自身的攻击力额外提升10%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","激情热场"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","无畏光环持续一定时间后将获得强化，对光环内友军周围的敌人持续造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当无畏光环单次累计持续6秒后，光环会获得强化：使光环内除自身以外的其他所有友方英雄获得“战斗怒火”效果，每秒对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成相当于曼卡拉攻击力50%的伤害。该强化效果会在光环结束后重置。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","受“战斗怒火”影响的友军，每秒对邻近敌人造成的伤害提高至曼卡拉攻击力的60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","受“战斗怒火”影响的友军还会提升30点受愈。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","受“战斗怒火”影响的友军，每秒对邻近敌人造成的伤害提高至曼卡拉攻击力的70%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","当己方控制荣耀擂台时，无畏光环的持续时间不会减少。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当己方控制荣耀擂台时，无畏光环的持续时间不会减少。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","激扬号铃"]]}